{#- The counter signs' masthead. Colour: the wordmark in a contained teal
    box. Black & white (`bw`): the name in type over a rule, because the
    wordmark is drawn to sit on teal and loses its outline in one ink. -#}
{%- if bw %}
<header class="sign-title-type">
    <h1 class="p-display sign-name">{{ site.name }}</h1>
</header>
{%- else %}
<header class="sign-mast">
    <div class="wordmark wordmark--light">
        {% inlineSvg "/assets/thecafe.svg", "", site.name %}
    </div>
</header>
{%- endif %}
